.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Quadrants that neighbor the local domain\&. 

See also the page \fBThe ghost layer\fP for general information\&. 
.SH "Field Documentation"
.PP 
.SS "sc_array_t p8est_ghost_t::ghosts"

.PP
An array of \fBp8est_quadrant_t\fP quadrants which make up the ghost layer around \fB\fBp8est\fP\fP\&. Their piggy3 (cf\&. \fBp8est_quadrant::p8est_quadrant_data\fP) data member is filled with their owner's tree and local number (cumulative over trees)\&. Quadrants are ordered in \fBp8est_quadrant_compare_piggy\fP order\&. These are quadrants inside the neighboring tree, i\&.e\&., \fCp8est_quadrant_is_inside\fP is true for the quadrant and the neighboring tree\&. 
.SS "\fBp4est_locidx_t\fP* p8est_ghost_t::mirror_proc_fronts"

.PP
like mirror_proc_mirrors, but limited to the outermost octants\&. This is NULL until p8est_ghost_expand is called 
.SS "sc_array_t p8est_ghost_t::mirrors"

.PP
An array of local quadrants that touch the parallel boundary from the inside, i\&.e\&., that are ghosts in the perspective of at least one other processor\&. The storage convention is the same as for \fCghosts\fP above\&. 

